        "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals_values\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"f65ad7b3131e8292351e8cdb80212a650b55942ab07b07c7d6d3de52f7fb0198\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"4ff1477f2ec71446f73ced70f81c50ee69c5c881559e8ad26956595a34010598\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"281ea88a8f48fcddfb6fc44bcd23227503a5a263174f483338754cf6ca3f3887\"},\"variables\":{\"music_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"},\"goals_values\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"goals_values\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\"},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals_values\",\"response\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"music_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"goals_values\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"response\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{\"music_history\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s34\",\"s35\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s43\",\"s22\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s23\",\"s14\",\"s44\",\"s10\",\"s26\",\"s25\"],\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s76\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s77\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s73\",\"s54\",\"s75\",\"s74\"],\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},\"goals_values\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s34\",\"s35\",\"s11\",\"s62\",\"s12\",\"s61\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s63\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s54\"],\"demand\":\"goals_values\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"value_ref\":\"t2\"}},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_419ccfcd7f3577a641bd2d8d\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s34\",\"s35\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s43\",\"s22\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s24\",\"s45\",\"s23\",\"s14\",\"s44\",\"s10\",\"s26\",\"s25\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations consistently describe a preference for emotional and experiential engagement with music over technical analysis. They report attending an electronic music festival in 2017 (s22-s23), finding music theory unappealing in 2018 (s24-s25), trying historical music research in 2020 but finding it tedious (s10-s11), enjoying live performances and album artwork/lyrics (s13-s14), creating music with nature field recordings (s43-s45), and feeling that passive consumption is less fulfilling than personal creation (s34-s35). They also expressed that diving too deep into technical aspects became a chore (s3) and that the essence of their love for music is emotional connection (s4).\",\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},{\"id\":\"fact_c705502daeea10cabc099a4c\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s76\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s77\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s73\",\"s54\",\"s75\",\"s74\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Multiple user statements across conversations consistently describe abandoning technical/analytical music activities (theory, production, historical research) due to loss of joy, and instead adopting emotionally resonant, creative, and culturally connected forms of engagement such as composing, attending live shows, exploring genres and stories, and creating heritage-inspired music.\",\"variable\":\"current_constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},{\"id\":\"fact_9de115f693135beabba365d0\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s34\",\"s35\",\"s11\",\"s62\",\"s12\",\"s61\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s63\",\"s3\",\"s53\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s54\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly states that diving too deep into technical aspects became a chore and that the essence of their love for music lies in emotional connection rather than analytical components (s3, s4). They found researching historical music trends tedious and overwhelming, preferring a less structured approach (s10, s11, s12). They describe engaging with music through genres, cultural significance, live performances, album artwork, lyrics, and playlists as more fulfilling (s13, s14). They express disappointment with a documentary that skimmed over the artistic process, and reflect that true connection comes from deeper engagement and personal creation (s34, s35). They later describe connecting with their roots through music, expressing identity and family history (s53, s54). Finally, they are blending traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app to empower others to do the same (s61, s62, s63). These statements collectively support the user's current goals and values regarding personal fulfillment and creative expression.\",\"variable\":\"goals_values\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t2\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,364,\"User: Yes, I attended another festival in 2017 that showcased electronic music, which was also eye-opening. The creativity displayed at that festival was nothing short of spectacular, with artists pushing the boundaries of sound in ways I had never imagined. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",364,655,\"There were vibrant visuals accompanying the music, and it felt like each performance was not just an auditory experience, but also a feast for the eyes. The diversity of electronic subgenres was a revelation; it really made me appreciate how broad and eclectic the music landscape is today. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",655,985,\"Each artist brought their own unique flavor, and it was thrilling to see how they engaged with the audience in real-time.\\n\\nUser: However, I realized that analyzing music theory wasn't my forte in 2018. As I sat through various classes, I found myself more focused on the emotional aspects of music rather than the technicalities. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",985,1287,\"It became evident that while I loved understanding how music is composed, diving into the intricacies of scales, modes, and harmonic structures just didn't resonate with me. Perhaps it was the way I primarily experienced music— through listening and feeling rather than dissecting the notes on a page. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",1287,1393,\"This realization pushed me to explore other realms in music, where my passion may flourish more naturally.\",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s74\",\"d8\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s75\",\"d8\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s76\",\"d8\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s77\",\"d8\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]]],\"required_parent_versions\":{\"music_history\":{},\"current_constraints\":{},\"goals_values\":{},\"response\":{\"music_history\":1,\"current_constraints\":1,\"goals_values\":1}},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"How can I f